(7073935, 1075970, 94815, '<td valign="top">Nice work with the yelloiw railing to link the two images.</td>', 'Nice work with the yelloiw railing to link the two images.', '2013-07-19 11:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7073949, 1075875, 94815, '<td valign="top">Effective inclusion of time as a causal element: the apparent distances involved and light change occuring in moving from one position to the other. Good take on the topic.</td>', 'Effective inclusion of time as a causal element: the apparent distances involved and light change occuring in moving from one position to the other. Good take on the topic.', '2013-07-19 12:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7074166, 1075877, 38162, '<td valign="top">wrong angle - the bench would not face that way.   love both shots though.  */*</td>', 'wrong angle - the bench would not face that way.   love both shots though.  */*', '2013-07-19 19:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7074325, 1075492, 112828, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done Robert.  Thank goodness, I was about to lose my mind.</td>', 'Very nicely done Robert.  Thank goodness, I was about to lose my mind.', '2013-07-19 23:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7074494, 1076016, 102315, '<td valign="top">Unique idea!</td>', 'Unique idea!', '2013-07-20 11:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7074577, 1076054, 134859, '<td valign="top">The detail on this is amazing.  The macro is wonderful!  Really love what you did with this photo!  Beautiful shots.  <br/>One of the highest voted in the challenge.  :)<br/>Bumping score up.</td>', 'The detail on this is amazing.  The macro is wonderful!  Really love what you did with this photo!  Beautiful shots.  One of the highest voted in the challenge.  :)Bumping score up.', '2013-07-20 15:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7074578, 1075492, 134859, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  Simple, yet effective.  Great editing, nothing over the top.  And you get a clear understanding of what the subject sees.  Bumping the score.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  Simple, yet effective.  Great editing, nothing over the top.  And you get a clear understanding of what the subject sees.  Bumping the score.', '2013-07-20 15:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7074579, 1076084, 134859, '<td valign="top">The grape''s future, perhaps?  I like this shot.  Nice detail.  Good editing.  Clear understanding of what the subject is.  Very nicely done.  Bumping score.</td>', 'The grape''s future, perhaps?  I like this shot.  Nice detail.  Good editing.  Clear understanding of what the subject is.  Very nicely done.  Bumping score.', '2013-07-20 15:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7074601, 1076069, 98022, '<td valign="top">Nice one. One small quibble - I think that the mom should have been the one in focus in the first photo since the second photo is from the mom''s viewpoint.</td>', 'Nice one. One small quibble - I think that the mom should have been the one in focus in the first photo since the second photo is from the mom''s viewpoint.', '2013-07-20 17:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7074694, 1076016, 100831, '<td valign="top">Ha!!! Time to move on...<br/> <br/>That clock is fabulous - two tails, the funny grin, the orange!! I really love this.</td>', 'Ha!!! Time to move on... That clock is fabulous - two tails, the funny grin, the orange!! I really love this.', '2013-07-20 21:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7075096, 1076069, 112828, '<td valign="top">This was so close...<br/> <br/>But let me ask you.  Is your subject in focus, or out of focus?<br/> <br/>Because if your subject is in focus, then she''s looking at the back of her own head.<br/> <br/>Really a shame honestly, since it was a great concept.</td>', 'This was so close... But let me ask you.  Is your subject in focus, or out of focus? Because if your subject is in focus, then she''s looking at the back of her own head. Really a shame honestly, since it was a great concept.', '2013-07-21 21:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7075101, 1075982, 112828, '<td valign="top">Order is reversed.  Maybe it is anyway.  Perhaps the subject is the man.<br/> <br/>Processing is nice here.  Concept is good too.</td>', 'Order is reversed.  Maybe it is anyway.  Perhaps the subject is the man. Processing is nice here.  Concept is good too.', '2013-07-21 21:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7075108, 1075877, 112828, '<td valign="top">Hmm.  Inconsistent.  Mostly the people are looking at people near them.  Order is arguably reversed, unless the beach was your subject, but I doubt it''d be too interested in those people...</td>', 'Hmm.  Inconsistent.  Mostly the people are looking at people near them.  Order is arguably reversed, unless the beach was your subject, but I doubt it''d be too interested in those people...', '2013-07-21 21:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7075110, 1075891, 112828, '<td valign="top">Why oh why?  A banjo player''s thigh has no eye.</td>', 'Why oh why?  A banjo player''s thigh has no eye.', '2013-07-21 21:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7075113, 1076044, 112828, '<td valign="top">Potatoes have eyes.  Pears do not.  Of course, even the old riddle acknowledges that potatoes can''t see.</td>', 'Potatoes have eyes.  Pears do not.  Of course, even the old riddle acknowledges that potatoes can''t see.', '2013-07-21 21:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7075118, 1076084, 112828, '<td valign="top">Inconsistent.  Subject cannot see, and grapes do not grow in a storeroom.<br/> <br/>Lovely image otherwise though.</td>', 'Inconsistent.  Subject cannot see, and grapes do not grow in a storeroom. Lovely image otherwise though.', '2013-07-21 21:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7075121, 1075987, 112828, '<td valign="top">Windows can''t really ''see'', and I would think that the window, should it be able to see, wouldn''t really be looking straight down like this.</td>', 'Windows can''t really ''see'', and I would think that the window, should it be able to see, wouldn''t really be looking straight down like this.', '2013-07-21 21:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7075124, 1076071, 112828, '<td valign="top">What''s the subject here?   Boots?<br/> <br/>If so, then the order is reversed.</td>', 'What''s the subject here?   Boots? If so, then the order is reversed.', '2013-07-21 21:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7075125, 1075875, 112828, '<td valign="top">Subject is???  Doesn''t work for me at all.</td>', 'Subject is???  Doesn''t work for me at all.', '2013-07-21 21:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7075126, 1076072, 112828, '<td valign="top">Well, you got the order right.  Images are very nice.<br/> <br/>Unfortunately, I don''t believe that this girl would be looking at the back of her own head... Totally inconsistent.</td>', 'Well, you got the order right.  Images are very nice. Unfortunately, I don''t believe that this girl would be looking at the back of her own head... Totally inconsistent.', '2013-07-21 21:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
