(7075138, 1075565, 112828, '<td valign="top">Superb view.<br/> <br/>I would have liked this better if the first image showed their faces from a side-on angle, but it''s still really nice. <br/> <br/>(I do wonder why they''re not drinking those drinks though... The lids are still on)</td>', 'Superb view. I would have liked this better if the first image showed their faces from a side-on angle, but it''s still really nice.  (I do wonder why they''re not drinking those drinks though... The lids are still on)', '2013-07-21 21:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7075139, 1075970, 112828, '<td valign="top">Very nicely consistent.<br/> <br/>I''ve got to say that the processing needs some help, the second image is a bit out of focus, and you''ve left a finger in the image.<br/> <br/>Still, you''re in the top ten.</td>', 'Very nicely consistent. I''ve got to say that the processing needs some help, the second image is a bit out of focus, and you''ve left a finger in the image. Still, you''re in the top ten.', '2013-07-21 21:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7075141, 1075978, 112828, '<td valign="top">First image is way too contrasty with too little dynamic range.<br/> <br/>Second image is excellent.<br/> <br/>You''ve done a nice job of meeting the challenge IMO.</td>', 'First image is way too contrasty with too little dynamic range. Second image is excellent. You''ve done a nice job of meeting the challenge IMO.', '2013-07-21 21:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7075143, 1075951, 112828, '<td valign="top">Even though I think you got the order wrong, the image is too good to not be loved!<br/> <br/>Great concept, and pretty well shot.  <br/> <br/>My big objection here is that both of the subjects are on a (forgive me) cruddy, dirty looking, and wrinkled backdrop. (The second image looks less dirty and more plastic like)...<br/> <br/>Why not just shoot this in a more natural environment?</td>', 'Even though I think you got the order wrong, the image is too good to not be loved! Great concept, and pretty well shot.   My big objection here is that both of the subjects are on a (forgive me) cruddy, dirty looking, and wrinkled backdrop. (The second image looks less dirty and more plastic like)... Why not just shoot this in a more natural environment?', '2013-07-21 21:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7075144, 1075598, 112828, '<td valign="top">Order is correct, and image is generally intriguing.  Well done.</td>', 'Order is correct, and image is generally intriguing.  Well done.', '2013-07-21 21:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7075147, 1076014, 112828, '<td valign="top">Order is correct, but I fear your white balance may be severely off.<br/> <br/>The strip in the middle of these images is a pinkish gray.</td>', 'Order is correct, but I fear your white balance may be severely off. The strip in the middle of these images is a pinkish gray.', '2013-07-21 21:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7075148, 1075434, 112828, '<td valign="top">Clever, although I think a border to separate two very similar images would have helped with the impact here.</td>', 'Clever, although I think a border to separate two very similar images would have helped with the impact here.', '2013-07-21 21:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7075149, 1076043, 112828, '<td valign="top">Sure, why not.<br/> <br/>You''ve met the challenge, but I don''t find this particularly compelling - it simply looks like two snapshots.</td>', 'Sure, why not. You''ve met the challenge, but I don''t find this particularly compelling - it simply looks like two snapshots.', '2013-07-21 21:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
